Vboard is licensed under the GNU GPL v3.0; the full text is in LICENSE.
(The LICENSE file was added here because the copied sources did not carry
one; the copyright notices in vboard/window.py are retained unchanged.)

DuoLinux modified this copy in 2026 while trying it as the on-screen keyboard
on KDE Plasma (docking, input backends, gesture handling). The approach was
REJECTED in favour of the wvkbd fork in ../wvkbd-0.15; this code is kept for
reference only, is not deployed, and is not maintained. Modifications are
released under the GNU GPL v3.0.
